on-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 1V13M13 7H1\"\/>\n      <\/svg>\n    <\/button>\n    <div class=\"qb-accordion-body\">\n      <p>The QB54 Game Set comes with 2 portable 600D Nylon camping chairs (supporting up to 275lbs each), 2 field goal posts, 1 inflatable rubber football, 1 kicking tee, 1 pump with needle, and 1 carry bag. We're confident you'll love the challenge and excitement this game brings, but if you encounter any issues, don't hesitate to contact us so we can make things right!<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- About -->\n  <div class=\"qb-accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"qb-accordion-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"qb-accordion-label\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M13.3333 2.49999V2.49999C15.1742 2.49999 16.6666 3.99238 16.6666 5.83333V12.7333C16.6666 14.6935 16.6666 15.6736 16.2851 16.4223C15.9496 17.0809 15.4141 17.6163 14.7556 17.9519C14.0069 18.3333 13.0268 18.3333 11.0666 18.3333H8.93325C6.97307 18.3333 5.99298 18.3333 5.24429 17.9519C4.58572 17.6163 4.05029 17.0809 3.71473 16.4223C3.33325 15.6736 3.33325 14.6935 3.33325 12.7333V5.83333C3.33325 3.99238 4.82564 2.49999 6.66659 2.49999V2.49999M13.3333 2.49999V2.49999C13.3333 1.57952 12.5871 0.833328 11.6666 0.833328H8.33325C7.41278 0.833328 6.66659 1.57952 6.66659 2.49999V2.49999M13.3333 2.49999V2.49999C13.3333 3.42047 12.5871 4.16666 11.6666 4.16666H8.33325C7.41278 4.16666 6.66659 3.42047 6.66659 2.49999V2.49999\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\n        <\/svg>\n        About\n      <\/span>\n      <svg class=\"qb-accordion-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 1V13M13 7H1\"\/>\n      <\/svg>\n    <\/button>\n    <div class=\"qb-accordion-body\">\n      <p><strong>UNLIMITED FOOTBALL FUN:<\/strong> QB54 is the innovative game that combines the excitement of football with the convenience of camping chairs. Score points through completions, touchdowns, interceptions, and field goals. Be the first team to reach 54 points and claim victory!<\/p>\n      <p><strong>TAILGATE THRILLS:<\/strong> Say hello to the ultimate tailgating companion! QB54 is a unique game and chair set that brings the fun and competition to any setting, from beach football to family outings, backyard sports, or lawn games.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>GAME DAY RIVALRY:<\/strong> Using the integrated chairs and goalposts, throw and kick the football to accumulate points. Once you've triumphed, take a seat and bask in your hard-earned glory. Perfect for Super Bowl parties and game day tailgating.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>VERSATILE AND PORTABLE:<\/strong> QB54 is the perfect blend of cornhole and classic yard games, replacing bean bags with a football for an exhilarating twist. Enjoy with kids, teens, and adults alike, whether you're at the beach, tailgate, picnic, party, or your own backyard.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- Shipping -->\n  <div class=\"qb-accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"qb-accordion-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"qb-accordion-label\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M8.33325 15.8333H11.6666M8.33325 15.8333C8.33325 17.2141 7.21396 18.3333 5.83325 18.3333C4.45254 18.3333 3.33325 17.2141 3.33325 15.8333M8.33325 15.8333C8.33325 14.4526 7.21396 13.3333 5.83325 13.3333C4.45254 13.3333 3.33325 14.4526 3.33325 15.8333M11.6666 15.8333C11.6666 17.2141 12.7859 18.3333 14.1666 18.3333C15.5473 18.3333 16.6666 17.2141 16.6666 15.8333M11.6666 15.8333C11.6666 14.4526 12.7859 